      "impact": "Scheduler always chooses append for that checkpoint. The new manager selects v2, while the collector only clears old recovery fields for a caller-selected backfill. Rust correctly rejects cross-profile append. Normal reconciliation retains its intent and the old canonical but cannot save subsequent content; later terminal observations repeat the same failure.",
